 {"id": "PEDS-U255", "ch": 30, "n": 5, "title": "Associations Continued — Genetic Syndromes (p135) & Teratogens", "sec": "Associations · p135", "qs": ["PEDS-C30-050", "PEDS-C30-051", "PEDS-C30-052", "PEDS-C30-053", "PEDS-C30-054", "PEDS-C30-055", "PEDS-C30-056", "PEDS-C30-057", "PEDS-C30-058"], "guide": "p135 rows: DiGeorge (CATCHaa, microdeletion) — TOF + conotruncal defects; Williams (microdeletion) — supravalvular aortic stenosis + elfin facies; Holt-Oram (autosomal dominant) — ASD + skeletal anomalies (absent radius/thumb); Alagille — PS, triangular face, cholestasis. Teratogens: Lithium → Ebstein's anomaly; Phenytoin → VSD; Alcohol → VSD."},
